@@ -24947,3 +24949,34 @@ Fable 5.1, GPT-6 Astra, Grok 4.7).  Each row's ledger `state_note` carries its s
   the Rc=1-only insertion skip, `CENSUS_SHRINK`, `R_NOGUARD`), moved here from `ppcrldimimask`, which the 2026-10-02
